      <h1>Europe Battery Market</h1>
      <p class="muted">Battery Market Intelligence · Data period 2024 (IEA) · Last reviewed 2026-09-16</p>

      <div class="box">
        <strong>Direct answer:</strong> Europe is a <strong>large battery consumer driven by EV adoption</strong> —
        roughly <strong>25% of new-car sales were electric in 2024</strong> — but it still imports a large share of its
        battery supply while building local production. The <a href="/battery-regulation/">EU Battery Regulation</a>
        is adding carbon-footprint, recycled-content and battery-passport requirements that are reshaping who can
        sell into the market.
      </div>

      <h2>What does the market look like?</h2>
      <table>
